  ],
  [
    "Is an espresso machine with a built-in grinder worth it?",
    "For most beginners, yes. A built-in grinder like the one on the Breville Barista Express means you grind fresh from day one without buying, matching and finding counter space for a second appliance. The trade-off is flexibility: a separate grinder is usually better and outlasts the machine. If you already know you will upgrade, buy the machine and grinder separately.",
  ],
  [
    "Do I need a 15-bar espresso machine?",
