  ],
  [
    "Is a dual boiler worth it?",
    "A dual boiler is worth it if you regularly make several milk drinks in a row, because you can brew and steam at the same time with stable temperature. For one or two drinks a day, a fast-heating single-boiler or ThermoJet machine is more practical and far cheaper.",
  ],
  [
    "Super-automatic or semi-automatic?",
    "Choose a super-automatic if convenience matters most and you are happy with a lighter, less concentrated shot. Choose a semi-automatic if you want the best flavour for the money and enjoy a hands-on routine. Many households with mixed preferences are happiest with a super-automatic.",
  ],
  [
    "What coffee beans are best for an at-home espresso machine?",
    "Fresh whole beans with a printed roast date beat any particular brand. Medium and medium-dark roasts are the easiest to dial in at home because they extract readily and taste balanced with milk. Let beans rest a few days after roasting, use them within about a month of opening, and grind just before brewing.",
  ],
  [
    "How long do home espresso machines last?",
    "Lifespan depends heavily on water quality and maintenance. Regular descaling, backflushing where supported, and replacing gaskets as they wear help machines last many years. Machines with widely available parts, like the Gaggia Classic, are easier to keep running.",
  ],
  [
    "Can I use pre-ground coffee in an espresso machine?",
    "You can, but results suffer because pre-ground coffee goes stale quickly and cannot be adjusted to the machine. Pressurised baskets, like those on budget machines, are more forgiving of pre-ground coffee. For good espresso, grind fresh.",
  ],
  [
    "What water should I use?",
    "Use filtered water that is not too hard and not completely demineralised. Filtered tap water reduces scale and improves flavour. Avoid fully distilled water in most machines, as some minerals help extraction and certain machines rely on them for sensors. Check your manual.",
  ],
];

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      itemListElement: [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 1,
          name: "Home",
          item: "https://www.thehonestreviewers.com/",
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 2,
          name: "Best Lists",
          item: "https://www.thehonestreviewers.com/best-of/",
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 3,
          name: "Best At-Home Espresso Machines",
          item: "https://www.thehonestreviewers.com/best-espresso-machine/",
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: FAQS.map(([q, a]) => ({
        "@type": "Question",
        name: q,
        acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: a },
      })),
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      author: authorSchema(Astro.url.pathname),
      datePublished: dates.published,
      dateModified: dates.modified,
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "The Honest Reviewers" },
    },
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      name: title,
      numberOfItems: PRODUCTS.length,
      itemListElement: PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => ({
        "@type": "ListItem",
        position: index + 1,
        name: product.name,
        url: new URL(`#${product.id}`, Astro.url).toString(),
      })),
    },
    ...PRODUCTS.map((product) => ({
      "@type": "Product",
      name: product.name,
      description: product.description,
      brand: {
        "@type": "Brand",
        name: product.name.split(" ")[0],
      },
    })),
  ],
};
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: dates.published,
    modifiedTime: dates.modified,
    author: authorName(Astro.url.pathname),
    section: "Home Appliances",
    tags: [
      "best at home espresso machine",
      "best espresso machine",
      "best home espresso machine",
      "best affordable at home espresso machine",
      "best at home espresso machine for baristas",
      "best at home espresso machine with grinder",
      "best espresso machine for beginners"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
